"HaHa翻译在这台 Mac 上识别与翻译文字，不把原文、译文或截图发送到翻译服务器。\n\n只有你主动下载模型或打开外部支持链接时才访问网络。模型托管方会接收提供下载所需的网络信息，例如 IP 地址；请求不包含你的翻译内容。\n\n术语表与自选开启的历史保存在本机，你可在应用中删除。模型可单独删除，不影响术语。截图仅在识别期间处理，不默认保存。\n\n联系方式：sapplex@icloud.com" = "HaHa Translate recognizes and translates text on this Mac. It does not send source text, translations, or screenshots to a translation server.\n\nThe app accesses the network only when you choose to download a model or open an external support link. The model host receives network information needed to deliver the download, such as your IP address. The request contains no translation content.\n\nYour glossary and optional history stay on this Mac and can be deleted in the app. Models can be deleted separately without affecting your glossary. Screenshots are processed during recognition and are not saved by default.\n\nContact: sapplex@icloud.com";
